<div id="urduTextPath">علی اکبر (ع)/زخمی سناں سے رن میں جو شہ کا پسر ہوا</div>
<p>zaqmi sinaa se ran me jo sheh ka pisar huwa<br />
har simt se laeen har ek hamlawar huwa<br />
tar khoon me muraqqa-e- qairul bashar huwa<br />
aaqir juda uqaab se wo seembar huwa</p>

<p>maqtal me kya hujoom tha us noor-e- ain par<br />
parwane gir rahe the charagh-e- hussain par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>girna tha bas ke sar pa laga gurz hai sitam<br />
yu jhuk gaye ke hote hai sajde me jaise qam<br />
rakhdi gale pa sheesh ne shamsheer-e- tez dam<br />
talwar ek padi ke huwi phasliyaa'n qalam</p>

<p>ghul tha karo na rehem tan-e- paash paash par<br />
doudha do ghode akbar-e- mahru ki laash par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hazrat khade the qaime ki thaame huwe tanaab<br />
sun kar ye ghul rahi na dil-e- naatawaa'n ko taab<br />
naagaah aayi ran se sada aye  falak janaab<br />
beta jaha'n se jaata hai ab aaiye shitaab</p>

<p>laashe pa zulm-o- jor bad affal karte hai<br />
ghodo'n se ahl-e- keen hame pamaal karte hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sunkar ye istaghasa-e- farzand-e- qushqisaal<br />
syed ne aah ki ke hilaa arsh-e- zuljalaal<br />
khole janaab-e- fatema ki betiyo'n ne baal<br />
bano pukari qair to hai aye ali ke laal</p>

<p>hai hai pisar se kounsi maadar bichad gayi<br />
saaheb bataao kya meri basti ujad gayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naize se kiske laal ka zaqmi huwa jigar<br />
karte hai kiski laash ko pamaal ahl-e- shar<br />
kehta hai koun ran me tadap kar pidar pidar<br />
ab ghar se mai nikalti hoo'n ya syedul bashar</p>

<p>parda na mujh se kijiye sab jaanti hoo'n mai<br />
aawaz ye usi ki hai pehchanti hoo'n mai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bano ko qasme'n deke chale shaah-e- naamdaar<br />
wo pyas aur wo dhoop ka sadma wo izteraab<br />
dil tha ulat pulat to kaleja tha be qaraar<br />
uth'te the aur zameen pa girte the baar baar</p>

<p>chillate the shabih-e payambar ham aate hai<br />
ghabraaiyo na aye ali akbar ham aate hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aau'n kidhar ko aye ali akbar jawab do<br />
chilla rahi hai dyodhi pa maadar jawaab do<br />
akbar baraa-e- qaaliq-e- akbar jawaab do<br />
beta jawaab do mere dilbar jawaab do</p>

<p>girte hai ham sawaab ka hatho'n se kaam lo<br />
beta zaeef baap ke baazu ko thaam lo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sun ke khainch'li sheh-e-wala ne zulfeqaar<br />
chamki jo barq tegh to bhaage sitam sheyaar<br />
sheh ko nazar pada ali akbar ka raah waar<br />
chillaye aye aqaab kidhar hai tera sawaar</p>

<p>dikhlade mujhko laash mere noor-e- ain ki<br />
kis dasht me padi hai bizaa'at hussain ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>Hichki ke sath kehte hai waa karke chashme tar<br />
Aye jaan jisme zaar me ek dam zara tehar<br />
Aye mout be watan ki jawaani pa reham kar<br />
Aye dard tham zara ke phadakta hai ab jigar<br /></p>

<p>Phir ek baar sayyade waala ko dekh lu'n<br />
Mohlat bas itni de ke mai baba ko dekh lu<br />
____________________________</p>
<p>dushman ko bhi na bete ka lasha quda dikhaaye<br />
hazrat zamee'n pa girke pukaare ke haaye haaye<br />
zinda rahe ye peer jawaa'n yu'n jahaa'n se jaaye<br />
aye laal teen roz ke faaqe me zaqm khaaye</p>

<p>shayad jigar ke zaqm se tum beqaraar ho<br />
zaqmi tumhaari chaati pa baba nisaar ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kyu'n khainchte ho paau'n ko aye mere gul-e-zaar<br />
kyu'n haath utha utha ke patakte ho baar baar<br />
aankhe'n to kholdo ke mera dil hai beqaraar<br />
beta tumhari maa ko tumhara hai intezaar</p>

<p>behne'n khadi hai dar pa tere ishteyaaq me<br />
akbar tumhari maa na jiyegi firaaq me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hazrat ye kehte the ke chala qalq se pisar<br />
itni zubaa'n hili ke khuda hafez aye pidar<br />
hichki jo aayi thaam liya haath se jigar<br />
angdaayi leke rakhdiya sheh ke qadam pa sar</p>

<p>aabad ghar luta sheh-e- waala ke saamne<br />
bete ka dam nikal gaya baba ke saamne<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>